# <%= current_page.data.title %>

This path to live section contains the setup guidance required to make a service operate correctly through the delivery environments, including non-production.

## Required for service setup workflow

- If you're building a frontend application, follow the relevant pages in this section.
- If you're building a backend application, start with
[Load balancer configuration](load-balancer-configuration.html) page.
- If you are only creating a new infrastructure project, you do not need to follow this section. Instead follow the [Starting a new component](/cloud-native-platform/new-component/) guide.

## Optional operational readiness guidance

- [Operational Acceptance Testing](oat.html)
- [Shuttering](shutter.html)



There may be other business processes you need to go through, but they are out of scope of this section.
